== a plain single quote lists the markers:
'ZQcommand_marker
'ZQdir_marker/
'ZQmarker_file
== an ANSI C quote lists the same markers:
$'ZQcommand_marker
$'ZQdir_marker/
$'ZQmarker_file
== an ANSI C escape resolves to the decoded name:
$'ZQdir_marker/\x5aQinner
== an ANSI C quote completes a command name:
$'ZQcommand_marker
== an ANSI C quote after a directory keeps the prefix:
ZQdir_marker/$'ZQinner
== a doubled dollar sign keeps the process id in the prefix:
== a tripled dollar sign keeps the process id before the quote body:
== a locale quote lists the same markers:
$"ZQcommand_marker
$"ZQdir_marker/
$"ZQmarker_file
== a locale quote completes a command name:
$"ZQcommand_marker
== a locale quote after a directory keeps the prefix:
ZQdir_marker/$"ZQinner
== a doubled dollar sign keeps the process id before a locale quote:
